# Atajos personalizados de GNOME (ArchLinux2/gnome-base.md, paso 5).
# Formato: nombre | atajo | comando
# Los que usan {{MONITOR_SERIAL}} solo se crean si MONITOR_SERIAL está definido
# en settings (número de serie del monitor externo: ddcutil detect).

ROG Control Center | XF86Launch1                 | rog-control-center
Aura Effect        | XF86Launch3                 | asusctl aura effect --next-mode
Power Plan         | XF86Launch4                 | asusctl profile next
Emoji              | <Alt><Super>e               | flatpak run it.mijorus.smile
Terminal           | <Super>q                    | ghostty
Mission Center     | <Shift><Control>Escape      | flatpak run io.missioncenter.MissionCenter
Screenshots        | <Shift><Super>s             | flatpak run be.alexandervanhee.gradia --screenshot=INTERACTIVE
Brightness Up      | <Control>XF86MonBrightnessUp   | ddcutil --sn {{MONITOR_SERIAL}} setvcp 10 + 10
Brightness Down    | <Control>XF86MonBrightnessDown | ddcutil --sn {{MONITOR_SERIAL}} setvcp 10 - 10
